      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an Instagram Reels viral content analysis specialist for faceless automated shadow pages. Analyze the data and return a JSON object only with no markdown. Return: {\"ai_report\": \"...\", \"wealthy_report\": \"...\"}"
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "Analyze this Instagram data and create two separate weekly reports.\n\nFor each report use this exact format (plain text, use emojis):\n\n🔥 TOP COMPETITOR REELS\nList top 5 by engagement % with: title/hook, views, engagement %, why it worked\n\n💡 WINNING PATTERNS\nTopics, Hooks, Triggers, Power Words, Trends\n\n🎯 10 HOOK IDEAS\nNumbered list of hooks with why each works\n\n📌 3 COPY-READY CAPTIONS\nReady to post with hashtags\n\nDATA:\n\nAI NICHE COMPETITORS:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.ai_competitors) }}\n\nWEALTHY NICHE COMPETITORS:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.wealthy_competitors) }}\n\nMY REELS:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.my_reels) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
